d80c0e64-03c8-4b72-961a-5c79ff988681	AI-Integrated E-Commerce Platform                                                                                     Live Demo                                                                        \n         Java, Spring Boot, React.js, MySQL, JWT, Vector Database, LLM                                                                                                                                          \n          •  Developed a full-stack e-commerce platform with a Spring Boot backend and React.js frontend.                                                                                                       \n          •  Integrated AI-powered product image generation using product names and descriptions.                                                                                                               \n          •  Implemented vector embeddings and similarity search for AI-enhanced product discovery.                                                                                                             \n          •  Secured application endpoints using JWT-based authentication and integrated AI functionality with backend ser-                                                                                     \n             vices.                                                                                                                                                                                             \n         EDUCATION                                                                                                                                                                                              \n         Dr.   D. Y. Patil Institute of Technology                                                                          2023 – 2027                                                                         \n         B.E. in Computer Engineering                                             